@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

actor Client as C
actor SysAdmin as SA
actor FinancialAdvisor as FA
system SFR012: "Client Dashboard Generation" as SDG
system AIFR009: "AI Predictive Interventions" as SPI
system AIFR008: "AI Predictive Insights" as API

rectangle System {
  usecase CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard as VFD
  usecase CFR002: Receive Alerts for Anomalous Transactions as RAT
  usecase CFR003: View Financial Predictions Based on Historical Data and Market Trends as FPMT
  usecase CFR004: Personalized Recommendations Aligned with Financial Profile and Goals as PRFG
  usecase CFR005: Manage Preferences for Personalized Recommendations as MPRP
  usecase CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts When Exceeding Thresholds as VSLA
  usecase CFR007: View Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profile as VOIP
  usecase CFR008: Access Consolidated Financial Information in a Single Dashboard as CFD
  usecase CFR010: Manage Relationship with Financial Advisors Including Data Sharing Permissions as MFADP

  usecase SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters for AI System as MAPS
  usecase FAFR001: Manage Client Mentoring Sessions Based on Insights as MCSI
  usecase FAFR002: View Client Intervention Alerts When Patterns Require Professional Attention as VCIAPRAA
  usecase FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics About Clients' Financial Situations to Guide Consultations as VPAGCFC
  usecase FAFR004: Configure Analysis Parameters for Specific Client Segments as CACS

  usecase SFR012: Generate Client Dashboards with Intuitive Formatting as GCDI
  usecase SPI: Generate Predictive Intervention Recommendations Based on AI Analyses as AIPRI
  usecase API: Generate Predictive Insights From AI Analyzes to Enhance Financial Guidance As APPIE

  C --> VFD : "Client requests financial insights."
  SA --> MAPS : "System Administrator manages analysis parameters."
  FA --> VCIAPRAA : "Financial Advisor views client intervention alerts."
  FA --> VPAGCFC : "Financial Advisor reviews predictive analytics for clients."
  SDG <|-- GCDI: "Client dashboard generation system creates dashboards."

  CFR011: Send Feedback to System as SF
}

@enduml